description=Local web hotspot management for rooted Android (KernelSU). Hotspot control, traffic quota, client management, scheduling, SMS forward, mihomo proxy, PushPlus/DingTalk notifications. Primarily tested on Xiaomi 14 / HyperOS 3 / Android 16. v1.7.0: built-in duplicate module dir self-check prevents KernelSU Manager list crash.
